## Interface: 16001
## Title: cr0m Inventory
## Notes: Records every character's bags, bank, warband and guild bank, gear, character sheet, talents, skills, recipes, trainers, reputation, quest log, Legacy challenges, location, where the Hearthstone is set and gold, plus vendor and auction house prices (/kinv ah), the cr0m raids you track (/kinv raid), the items each character crafts (counted as they are made), default-on drop (also group-loot roll lists, with the boss and what you won), quest (with quest text, objectives and places, level, XP, the reputation it changes and the rewards its window lists, its money too), the reputation a kill gives, what disenchanting gives, vendor, trainer (what each class or profession trainer teaches and charges) flight master (where you can fly, the price and how long it takes), gossip, readable page and NPC line recording, a summary of the NPCs you look at (level, health and power, type, reaction, subtitle, services, where they stand, also inside instances), each item's own facts (read once, a little at a time, never in combat) and the creatures you kill per day, for cr0m's item database (/kinv track), and copies KutzUI's addon-monitor findings for export with tools/inventory_export.js.
## X-Category: cr0m
## Author: ljk5000
